  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mediterranean Wildfire Relief Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wildfires are displacing communities across countries including Algeria, Greece, Italy, and Tunisia. Thousands of firefighters are battling these devastating fires which have been fueled by scorching temperatures and strong winds. The fires have killed dozens of people, especially in Algeria. Thousands of families have been evacuated. Your donation to the Mediterranean Wildfire Relief Fund will support emergency response and long-term recovery efforts in the most affected countries.</narrative>
  </description>
